      "cooked": "<p>Setback, Guise, Expatriette, The Sentinels, and Luminary attempt to defeat Kaargra Warfang in the time-honored sport of baseball at Champion Studios.<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/9/9343aef2585b102ca5c0d297a732e117e248cd59.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/9343aef2585b102ca5c0d297a732e117e248cd59\" title=\"IMG_0087\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/9343aef2585b102ca5c0d297a732e117e248cd59_2_666x500.jpeg\" alt=\"IMG_0087\" data-base62-sha1=\"l0LcluJWshUwrjNDRD4JtVtHK6l\" width=\"666\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/9343aef2585b102ca5c0d297a732e117e248cd59_2_666x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/9343aef2585b102ca5c0d297a732e117e248cd59_2_999x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/9343aef2585b102ca5c0d297a732e117e248cd59_2_1332x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/9343aef2585b102ca5c0d297a732e117e248cd59_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">IMG_0087</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×1440 294 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div><br>\nI say attempt because that’s how my first try went. Mind breaker+Indiscriminate Kaargra ruined my team, and I lost on Guise’s turn.</p>",
