      "username": "FrivYeti",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/frivyeti/{size}/1919_2.png",
      "created_at": "2023-08-16T15:48:20.012Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Easy mint for me; I managed to get Friendly Fire, Mindbreaker, Indiscriminate and the healing Title onto Setback, Human Shield and Durasteel Chains onto Mainstay, and Chaos Lord onto Guise.</p>\n<p>The result was that whenever any of my heroes did anything, they could poke Setback for 2, at which point he would heal for 1 and attack all heroes and villains for 2, and then Mainstay would absorb all of the damage harmlessly except for a poke at Guise, who would then play a free card. The Sentinels kept healing Setback and Guise up, and I overwhelmed Kaargra with incredible speed.</p>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2023-08-16T15:48:20.012Z",
      "reply_count": 1,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
