    {
      "id": 253627,
      "name": "doppelgangerung",
      "username": "doppelgangerung",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/doppelgangerung/{size}/1876_2.png",
      "created_at": "2023-08-17T15:48:34.621Z",
      "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/5/5f453e7e69da6fc166416239f0bb595bdf8f81b1.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/5f453e7e69da6fc166416239f0bb595bdf8f81b1\" title=\"Screenshot_20230815-133332\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5f453e7e69da6fc166416239f0bb595bdf8f81b1_2_219x500.jpeg\" alt=\"Screenshot_20230815-133332\" data-base62-sha1=\"dANIiE00dPOyu67KtNPZ9u9usYp\" width=\"219\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5f453e7e69da6fc166416239f0bb595bdf8f81b1_2_219x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5f453e7e69da6fc166416239f0bb595bdf8f81b1_2_328x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5f453e7e69da6fc166416239f0bb595bdf8f81b1_2_438x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5f453e7e69da6fc166416239f0bb595bdf8f81b1_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot_20230815-133332</span><span class=\"informations\">1080×2460 188 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>A real nail-biter - Setback ended up with “Reckless” and “The Unbreakable” and a Sabre Battle Drone got “Ironjaw”</p>\n<p>Flipped Kaargra Warfang by clearing the board of gladiators, a rare occurrence for me.</p>\n<p>“The Seeker” got passed around from one gladiator to the next, and while Kaargra did end up with “The Mindbreaker” in the final round, its effects were largely neutralized by Luminary’s Regression Turret.</p>\n<p>Luminary got in a Bared Blade to strike the final blow against Kaargra with the favor pool at 20-19, and the heroes celebrated their narrow victory!</p>",
